    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ali Omukali khukhila Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawandaayase bakristo, lundi nibo Wele alaanga! Yibaasia khu Yesu, niye Wele aruma khuuba Omusaayi Omukhulu Lukali owe lisuubila nilio khwiyama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.12.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khub. 12.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aaba omusuubilwa khu Wele, owamurobora khukhola kimilimo kino, bulayi bwene nga Musa ne aba omusuubilwa mu milimo kiewe munju eya Wele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu owombakha enju anyoolanga lukoosi lukali khukhila enju eng'ene. Mu ngila ng'eneyo Yesu akhoya abe ne lukoosi lukali khukhila Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli enju, kakhaba kario, yombakhangwa no mundu, mala Wele niye owombakha bibiindu bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa aba omusuubilwa munju eya Wele nga omukholi, mala alomaloma khuloondekhana ne bibiindu nibio Wele akhalome mu ndaalo chichiicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali Kristo ali omusuubilwa nga omwana weseecha mu bwimeelesi bwenju eya Wele. Efwe khuli enju yewe ne khuchiililila khuba ne bunyindaafu ne lisuubila mu nibio khwiyikina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Liiola lie babaandu ba Wele",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basuubili basiaase, lola bulayi, yesi yesi mwinywe akhaba owe kumwoyo kuli kumubi lukali lundi kukhasuubila tawe, akhola ario alekha khusuubila Wele omenyile mindali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali, nio yesi yesi khwinywe alekhe khuombelesibwa ne bubwoni mala abe ne sileka tawe, mukhoya muchuubane buli ndaalo, nga likhuwa “Luno” mu maandiko lichiililila khuboola khwifwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila efwe khuli basaangi ne Kristo, khwaba ne khwiandalasia khukhwola ematabusia mu lieyikina nilio khwaba nalio ekhurakikha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
